9	/**
10	 * Emits, to the dedicated {@code AUDIT} logger, two records for a successfully created owner:
11	 * the human-readable audit line (owner id, {@code customerCode}, {@code registrationDate},
12	 * {@code membershipLevel}, {@code membershipNumber}) and an immutable structured
13	 * {@link OwnerCreatedEvent} serialized as JSON. Runs after {@link SaveOwner} (so the generated
14	 * id exists) and before {@link RespondWithOwnerCreated} responds.
